Usage: nproc [OPTION]...

Print the number of processing units available.

This is useful for scripts that need to know how many parallel
processes can be started.

OPTIONS:
      --all         print number of all installed processors
      --ignore ARG  ignore N processors
      --help        display this help and exit
  -V, --version     output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
